      "postID": "5a1b05dd1219c96407672d59",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "There's actually several integrations that you could tie into Discord from VRChat. \n\nGamebridge: https://discordapp.com/gamebridge\nRich Presence (less work, more interesting features): https://discordapp.com/rich-presence\n\nRich Presence in particular offers a lot of cool ideas. You could join on someone in a world and launch VRChat directly to that world, or invite someone to a world from Discord if they're offline.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5a1d1d5a1a7af23ba89b1731",
      "author": {
        "_id": "59e59c1cda46f215cddef5f6",
        "alias": "Iris Chipmunk",
        "aliasID": "65ba017ced6eefce4cf2ec3e",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/38dee6ae7806ef6ce225696f152f3438.png",
        "created": "2017-10-17T05:58:52.379Z",
        "name": "Kouki Elska",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": null
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62efae9868f3662e9d9a1",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2017-11-28T08:24:58.281Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
      "files": [],
      "imageURLs": [],
      "integrationSourceType": null,
      "internal": false,
      "itemSourceType": null,
      "likeCount": 0,
      "mentionedUserIDs": null,
      "mentionedUsers": [],
      "mergeID": null,
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5a1b05dd1219c96407672d59",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "I honestly think it's just best that they implement an in-game public chat for worlds, because I think if they only implemented a way to text-chat by private messaging someone within the same room, it would leave conversations in the online world exclusive from other people in the same public world.\n\nPlus, text-chat users probably know the frustration of not being able to talk to groups of people immediately in-world, whether from being ignored, the person not using Discord, or the person not understanding what you want. \nI think it wouldn't help with participating in group activities either, especially if they're actively doing stuff like moving around, since everyone is likely to be ignoring Discord if they have to alt-tab or otherwise put any effort to see it.\n\nThat is the thing in VRChat, it's worlds where everyone in the area is included in everything happening immediately in that world, and this could make the community seem more anti-social than it really is, if the only option to text-type is in private.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5a1ea2b386eb091cf76d41b4",
      "author": {
        "_id": "58c6b8f8227a56787575ebc0",
        "alias": "Iris Hummingbird",
        "aliasID": "65ba012ced6eefce4cea0f6a",
        "anonymized": false,
        "avatarURL": "https://canny.io/images/6264a792b14c637dbe34e8405667ffc6.png",
        "created": "2017-03-13T15:21:28.513Z",
        "name": "Zarniwoop",
        "serviceAccount": false,
        "urlName": null
      },
      "authorID": null,
      "boardID": "58c62efae9868f3662e9d9a1",
      "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
      "created": "2017-11-29T12:06:11.417Z",
      "deleted": false,
      "fileURLs": [],
