      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5a1b05dd1219c96407672d59",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "Going further with this, I think Discord integration would be perfect for voice calls inside VRchat. It's been talked about before having voice calls instead of, or as an alternative to text PMs between users.\nTo be able to voice call a user you first need to connect your VRC account with your discord account and be on the VRC discord and the receiver obviously needs to do the same. When a call is established everyone elses voice dims and you see a hologram of the other users avatar in front of you at all times. The voice call would go through discord.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
